## Stage 4: Markdown Sync completion

Update core/sync_engine.py to add file watching (watchdog) for the QMD directory.
When a .md file in QMD dir changes, diff it against the stored memory, and either update or create a new Memory entry.
Uses inotify/watchdog for real-time detection.

## Stage 5: Replace hash embedder with bge-m3

Update core/embeddings.py:
- Remove the hash-based placeholder
- Use sentence-transformers with bge-m3 model
- Config: HCC_EMBEDDING_MODEL (default: BAAI/bge-m3), HCC_EMBEDDING_DIM (default: 1024)
- Add onnx support for faster inference
- Add sentencetransformers dep to pyproject.toml
- Cache model loading

Do NOT modify gateway/api/ files. Keep backward compatibility.
